OL,3,AIranian attack on Saudi tanker killed
OL,4,Atwo Filipino sailors, Saudi Arabia says
OL,5,
OL,6,FIran has not responded to the Saudi
OL,7,Fallegation. But it said earlier that
OL,8,Ftwo tankers had caught fire after
OL,9,Fhitting mines while using an
OL,10,Funauthorised route through the strait.
